atextbtxt2rdacontent  acomputerbc2rdamedia  aonline resourcebcr2rdacarrier1 aCeased in 2025.  aThis is a publication issued by the United States federal government or produced with federal funds.  aIn scope of the U.S. Government Publishing Office Cataloging and Indexing Program (C&I) and Federal Depository Library Program (FDLP).  aNews and updates of Service annual survey. This survey collected data from companies whose primary business or operation was to provide services to individuals, businesses, and governments (NAICS sectors 22, 48-49, 51, 52, 53, 54, 56, 61, 62, 71, 72, and 81). Industry coverage and detail had been expanded since 1982, and included most personal, business, automotive, amusement and recreation, social welfare, health care, and other professional services.  aAbsorbed the print and online formats of Current business reports. Service annual survey.  aMerged with: Annual capital expenditures survey, Annual retail trade survey, Annual Survey of manufacturers, Annual wholesale trade survey, Manufacturers' unfilled orders survey, Report of organization, to form: Annual integrated economic survey.0 aPage last revised - September 8, 2025; title from web page (viewed Sept. 24, 2026). 0aIndustrial surveyszUnited States. 0aService industrieszUnited StatesvStatistics. 7aSurveys.2lcgft0http://id.loc.gov/authorities/genreForms/gf2026026017 7aStatistics.2lcgft0http://id.loc.gov/authorities/genreForms/gf20140261812 aU.S. Census Bureau,eissuing body.0http://id.loc.gov/authorities/names/no200310060105tCurrent business reports. Service annual surveyg2011w(DLC) 86642553w(OCoLC)997778605tCurrent business reports. Service annual surveyg2011w(DLC) 2006230080w(OCoLC)7011365307tAnnual capital expenditures surveyw(DLC) 2026229190w(OCoLC)161891317607tAnnual retail trade surveyw(DLC) 2026229191w(OCoLC)161891842107tAnnual survey of manufacturersw(DLC) 2026229192w(OCoLC)161891892407tAnnual wholesale trad