establishment level.  aMerged with: Annual capital expenditures survey, Annual retail trade survey, Annual Survey of manufacturers, Annual wholesale trade survey, Manufacturers' unfilled orders survey, Service annual survey, to form: Annual integrated economic survey.0 aPage last revised - September 8, 2025; title from web page (viewed Sept. 24, 2026). 0aIndustrial surveyszUnited States. 0aIndustrial statisticszUnited States.0http://id.loc.gov/authorities/subjects/sh85140359 0aBusiness enterpriseszUnited StatesvStatistics. 7aSurveys.2lcgft0http://id.loc.gov/authorities/genreForms/gf2026026017 7aStatistics.2lcgft0http://id.loc.gov/authorities/genreForms/gf20140261812 aU.S. Census Bureau,eissuing body.0http://id.loc.gov/authorities/names/no200310060107tAnnual capital expenditures surveyw(DLC) 2026229190w(OCoLC)161891317607tAnnual retail trade surveyw(DLC) 2026229191w(OCoLC)161891842107tAnnual survey of manufacturersw(DLC) 2026229192w(OCoLC)161891892407tAnnual wholesale trade surveyw(DLC) 2026229193w(OCoLC)161892798707tManufacturers' unfilled orders (M3UFO) surveyw(DLC) 2026229194w(OCoLC)161893701307tService annual surveyw(DLC) 2026229196w(OCoLC)161893874907tAnnual integrated economic surveyw(DLC) 2026229189w(OCoLC)161893876140uhttps://purl.fdlp.gov/GPO/gpo260295704 zAddress at time of PURL creationuhttps://www.census.gov/programs-surveys/cos.html  aC0bGPO  abc72 20260928b20260928  aCONSERNEWb20260928  aUNREPORTEDPUBSASKGPOb20260928  aISSNREQb20260928  aVEND01b2026102803400cai a2200601 i 00147998220261001134832.0m     o  d        cr |||||||||||260928d20uu2025mduar w o    f0    2eng c  a2026229194  a(OCoLC)1618937013  aGPObengerdaepncGPOdGPO  apcc  an-us---  aGPOO  a0146 (online)0 aC 3.2:M 31/9/2/00aManufacturers' unfilled orders (M3UFO) survey. 1a[Suitland, Md.] :bUnited States Census Bureau,c-2025.  a1 online resource  aUpdated irregularly  atextbtxt2rdacontent  acomputerbc2rdamedia  aonline resourcebcr2rdacarrier1 aCeased in 2025.  aThis is a publication issued by the United States federal government or produced with federal funds.  aIn scope of the U.S. Government Publishing Office Cataloging and Indexing Program (C&I) and Federal Depository Library Program (FDLP).  aThe data collected in the Manufacturers' Unfilled Orders (M3UFO) Survey was used to benchmark the new and unfilled orders information published in the monthly Manufacturers' Shipments, Inventories, and Orders (M3) Survey, which is an economic indicator survey based on a panel of domestic manufacturers. The collected annual sales data was used to analyze differences in reporting between the company-based survey and plant level data from the Annual Survey of Manufactures, the source of benchmark data for the monthly shipments and inventory data.  aMerged with: Annual capital expenditures survey, Annual retail trade survey, Annual Survey of Manufacturers, Annual wholesale trade survey, Manufacturers' unfilled orders survey, Report of organization, Service annual survey, to form: Annual integrated economic survey.0 aPage last revised - September 8, 2025; title from web page (viewed Sept. 24, 2026). 0aIndustrial surveyszUnited States. 0aManufactureszUnited StatesxStatistics. 7aSurveys.2lcgft0http://id.loc.gov/authorities/genreForms/gf2026026017 7aStatistics.2lcgft0http://id.loc.gov/authorities/genreForms/gf20140261812 aU.S. Census Bureau,eissuing body.0http://id.loc.gov/authorities/names/no200310060107tAnnual capital expenditures surveyw(DLC) 2026229190w(OCoLC)161891317607tAnnual retail trade surveyw(DLC) 2026229191w(OCoLC)161891842107tAnnual survey of manufacturersw(DLC) 2026229192w(OCoLC)161891892407tAnnual wholesale trade surveyw(DLC) 2026229193w(OCoLC)161892798707tReport of organizationw(DLC) 2026229195w(OCoLC)161893841607tService annual surveyw(DLC) 2026229196w(OCoLC)161893874907tA